# Wayfinder working area.
#
# .scratch/research/ IS tracked — it is the evidence base every ticket cites.
# .scratch/tickets/  is NOT: those bodies were published as GitHub issues, which
# are canonical. Keeping a second copy here would let the two drift.
.scratch/*
!.scratch/research/
!.scratch/issue-map.json

# Elixir
/_build/
/cover/
/deps/
/doc/
/.fetch
erl_crash.dump
*.ez
*.beam
/config/*.secret.exs
.elixir_ls/
.DS_Store
